This directory contains station metadata distributed by the National Oceanic
and Atmospheric Administration (NOAA) through the Meteorological Assimilation
Data Ingest System (MADIS).

This product uses MADIS data but is not endorsed or certified by NOAA, the
National Weather Service, or any MADIS data provider. The data are not covered
by the software license of this package.

Dataset:

  MADIS public station table

  public_stntbl.csv

Source:

  https://madis-data.ncep.noaa.gov/madisPublic1/data/stations/public_stntbl.csv,
  accessed August 2026

This file is publicly distributed by NOAA. MADIS incorporates information from
NOAA and non-NOAA observing networks, and some provider data may be subject to
use or redistribution restrictions. This package does not grant additional
rights to the data.

For more information, see the MADIS dataset restrictions and National Weather
Service reuse policy:

  https://madis.ncep.noaa.gov/madis_restrictions.shtml

